; The blob store touches no DOM — it is a registry of Brr.Blob.t values — so
; this suite needs no dom_shim.js. It runs under Node via js_of_ocaml using
; Node's global Blob constructor, which is what Brr.Blob.of_jstr builds on.
; js_of_ocaml is deliberately absent from (libraries): (modes js) already
; selects the JS toolchain, and listing it makes opam-dune-lint demand a
; {with-test} dependency in every .opam file the suite transitively touches.

(test
 (name test_blob_store)
 (package nopal_blob_web)
 (libraries nopal_blob_web alcotest brr)
 (modes js)
 (js_of_ocaml))
